1
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,160
Start an idea, fund it on-chain.

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:05,610
A founder sets a target and a deadline.

3
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:09,360
You buy in with SOL or USDC.

4
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:14,110
If the target is met, the raise seeds as a tradeable token.

5
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,570
If it misses, every wallet gets back exactly what it paid.

6
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,320
Seeded in full, or refunded in full.
